Package: taur
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: WeirdBrains <taur@weirdbrains.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/WeirdBrains/taur
Depends: git, adduser, libc6 (>= 2.31)@EXTRA_DEPENDS@
Recommends: systemd
Description: AUR-compatible package server
 TAUR serves an AUR-compatible package index over HTTP. The package installs
 the server and taurctl, man pages, docs, and a systemd unit. It does not
 enable or start the service. Enable it with: systemctl enable --now taur
